What is AI Contract Management Software?
AI Contract Management Software is a technology solution that leverages artificial intelligence to automate and streamline various aspects of contract lifecycle management (CLM). By analyzing contracts, extracting key clauses, identifying risks, and generating actionable insights, these platforms help organizations manage agreements more effectively-reducing errors, saving time, and mitigating legal and financial exposure. Key deployment models include cloud-based and on-premise solutions, each offering distinct advantages depending on organizational size, regulatory environment, and infrastructure preferences.

